Nine Craft Modpack
Copyright (c) 2026 Nine Craft (xTri6). All Rights Reserved.

This covers the original Nine Craft content in this repository:
  - the quest book: quest text, chapter layouts, loot tables and chapter
    artwork in overrides/config/ftbquests and overrides/kubejs/assets/ninecraft
  - the Nine Craft logo, banners, dividers and other files in assets/branding
  - the screenshots in assets/screenshots
  - the README, MODLIST and other documentation

You may use, edit and redistribute this content as part of the Nine Craft
modpack, and you may modify it for your own private play or private servers.
Copying it into other public modpacks requires written permission from the
Nine Craft team.

Mods are NOT included in this repository. manifest.json only references mods
hosted on CurseForge, and each mod remains the property of its author under
its own license. Mod names, item names and item textures shown in the quest
book belong to their respective mod authors. See MODLIST.md for credits.
